# Grid Table Library Rules

Every prop must be optional (except data and columns).
All new features must be additive, never breaking.
No external runtime dependencies beyond @forgedevstack/bear.
All effects controlled via tableEffects prop.
Tree/expand via defaultExpandedIds prop.
Lazy load via lazyLoad prop.
Cell editing via editable on ColumnDefinition.
Export via enableExport prop.
CSS class prefix: gt- for library styles.
Animations conditional on parent class (gt-sort-animated, gt-row-animated, gt-hover-effect).
